Package: printer-driver-brother-td
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 cups-filters,
 ghostscript,
Recommends:
 cups,
Description: CUPS driver for Brother TD-4D label printers
 A native CUPS raster filter and PPDs for Brother TD-4D series direct
 thermal label printers.
 .
 It supports die-cut labels and continuous rolls, 203 dpi and 300 dpi
 models, several dithering algorithms, scaling/rotation, copies, and
 optional auto-cut/peeler control.  The driver speaks the printer's native
 raster command language and works with the standard CUPS USB and network
 backends.

Package: brother-td-printer-app
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ghostscript,
Recommends:
 cups,
Description: PAPPL/IPP Everywhere printer application for Brother TD-4D
 A native PAPPL printer application for Brother TD-4D series direct
 thermal label printers.
 .
 Unlike the PPD driver, this application exposes the printer as an IPP
 Everywhere/AirPrint printer and can be used with CUPS 3 and other
 driverless clients.  It accepts PWG/Apple raster directly and uses
 Ghostscript for PDF and PostScript jobs.
